# compiled output
/dist
/node_modules
# TypeScript 6 writes these beside the config rather than inside outDir the
# way it used to, so both build configs name a `tsBuildInfoFile` under `dist`
# and nothing lands here. This stays as a net for a config that forgets to.
*.tsbuildinfo

